  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/default/1",
    "raw": "Select a research by clicking one of the icons on the grid.\nYou can navigate the grid by dragging with the left mouse button.\n\n- The left most button at the upper part of the screen opens a list of research trees to pick from.\n\n- The second button opens a list of non-hidden research options. Click a research on the displayed to center the view on it. Click again to hide the list.\n\n- The third button will center the view on the middle of the tree, or the currently selected research.\n\n- The last button toggles ^orange;low quality mode^reset;. This makes the GUI jump to a position instead of panning to it, or the center button. In addition, dragging/navigating on the the main screen will update only after you release the mouse button. It is best to use the search list with this mode enabled.",
    "value": "通过点击网格上的图标来选择一项研究。\n您可以通过按住鼠标左键拖动来导航网格。\n\n- 屏幕顶部最左侧的按钮用于打开可供选择的研究树列表。\n\n- 第二个按钮用于打开非隐藏的研究选项列表。点击列表中显示的研究项，可将视图居中定位到该研究的图标上。再次点击该按钮可隐藏列表。\n\n- 第三个按钮用于将视图居中定位到科技树的中心，或者当前选中的研究项目上。\n\n- 最后一个按钮用于切换 ^orange;低质量模式^reset;。此模式下，界面将直接跳转到目标位置，而非通过平移动画（搜索列表或居中按钮触发的动画）移动。此外，在主屏幕上的拖动导航操作，仅在释放鼠标按钮后才会更新视图。建议在此模式下使用搜索列表功能。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/survival_1/0",
    "raw": "Basic Training",
    "value": "基础训练"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/survival_1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 0^reset;\n\nYour training, thanks to four years in the Protectorate Academy, provides you with basic survival skills to keep you alive for extended periods in the event of a crash. This includes basic chemistry knowledge.",
    "value": "^orange;0级^reset;\n\n得益于在守护团学院的四年学习，您所受的训练为你提供了基本的生存技能，确保在发生坠机等意外时能够长时间维持生命。这包括基础的化学知识。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/chemistryn/0",
    "raw": "Chemistry",
    "value": "化学"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/chemistryn/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nChemistry is a wonderful field with many practical applications such as the creation of plastics, bombs, medicine, fertilizer or biodiesel. With the ability to make an ^orange;Alchemy Table^reset; at your ^orange;Machining Table^reset;, you're now ready to start exploring its potential.",
    "value": "^orange;1级^reset;\n\n化学是一个充满魅力的领域，拥有诸多实际应用，例如制造塑料、炸弹、医药、化肥或生物柴油。既然您已能在^orange;加工台^reset;处制造^orange;炼金台^reset;，现在便可以开始探索它的潜力了。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/optics1/0",
    "raw": "Simple Optics",
    "value": "简单光学"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/optics1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nMicroscopes are extremely useful, allowing you to scan Bees for their genetic capabilities as well as generate research from investigated artifacts and equipment.\n\nThis microscope is available in an ^orange;Auto-Assembler^reset;.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n显微镜极为实用，它使您能够扫描蜜蜂的基因特性，并能根据已研究的文物与设备生成研究数据。\n\n此显微镜可通过^orange;自动组装器^reset;制造。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/optics2/0",
    "raw": "Complex Optics",
    "value": "复杂光学"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/optics2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou're able to create much better microscopes now, enhancing your production rates.\n\nThis microscope is available in a ^orange;Matter Assembler^reset;.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n现在，您已能制造性能更优异的显微镜，从而提升生产效率。\n\n此显微镜可通过 ^orange;物质汇编机^reset; 组装。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/optics3/0",
    "raw": "Advanced Optics",
    "value": "高级光学"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/optics3/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYour microscopes are getting quite good now, allowing extreme zoom and fantastic clarity.\n\nThis microscope is available in a ^orange;Matter Assembler^reset;.",
    "value": "^orange;4级^reset;\n\n您的显微镜性能现已相当出色，能够实现极高的放大倍数和非凡的清晰度。\n\n此显微镜可通过 ^orange;物质汇编机^reset; 组装。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/optics4/0",
    "raw": "Master Optics",
    "value": "大师光学"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/optics4/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nYour microscopes are a thing of beauty, allowing you to see into microcosms previously unknown.\n\nThis microscope is available in a ^orange;Power Station^reset;.",
    "value": "^orange;5级^reset;\n\n您的显微镜堪称一件精美的杰作，使您得以窥见以往未知的微观世界。\n\n此显微镜可通过 ^orange;能源设备制造器^reset; 组装。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/plastic1/0",
    "raw": "Simple Plastics",
    "value": "简单塑料"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/plastic1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've learned to create a simple, flexible plastic material that is especially helpful in the creation of electronics and wearables.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n您已学会制造一种简易的柔性塑料材料，这种材料在制造电子产品和可穿戴设备时特别有用。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/plastic2/0",
    "raw": "Complex Plastics",
    "value": "复合塑料"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/plastic2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nHaving learned a lot about plastic creation, you can now create a much more potent rigid plastic that is extremely durable and quite heat-proof. Advanced Plastic is a key ingredient in tons of things, and you can almost never have enough. Luckily, you've learned of several different ways to make this substance, though you'll probably be deriving it from petrol most of the time.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n在掌握了大量塑料制造知识后，您现在可以制造一种更高效能的刚性塑料，它具有极强的耐用性和出色的耐热性。高级塑料是众多产品的关键成分，因此您几乎永远会觉得供不应求。幸运的是，您已学会了制造这种物质的几种不同方法，尽管大部分时候您可能还是从石油中提取。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/graphene/0",
    "raw": "Carbon Latticing",
    "value": "碳晶格化"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/graphene/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nGraphene is one of the most wonderful substances ever created, and now you know how to make it yourself. A one-atom thick sheet of hexagonal graphite, graphene is ridiculously durable. In addition to being a key component in many powerful weapons and armor, graphene is also very useful in the creation of complex circuitry.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n石墨烯是有史以来最非凡的物质之一，现在您已懂得如何自行制造它了。这种仅有一个原子厚度的六角形石墨薄片，具有惊人的耐久性。它不仅是许多强大武器和装甲的关键成分，在制造复杂电路方面也非常有用。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/morphite/0",
    "raw": "Morphic Super-Compounds",
    "value": "形态超复合物"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/morphite/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nThrough intense experimentation, you've learned to create an amazing substance that exploits the strange properties of phase matter to be simultaneously incredibly durable and highly moldable. Besides its use in weapons and armor, it's also quite conductive and will allow amazing new electronic devices to be made.\n\nYour knowledge of phasic materials has also allowed you to create 'blocks' of raw matter in your lab that are useful for a couple different esoteric reactions.",
    "value": "^orange;4级^reset;\n\n通过大量的实验，您已学会制造一种奇妙的物质，它能利用相位物质的奇特属性，同时具备难以置信的耐久性和高度可塑性。除了用于武器和装甲，它还具有良好的导电性，可用于制造令人惊叹的新型电子设备。\n\n您对相位材料的了解，也使您能够在实验室中制造出可用于几种不同深奥反应的原始物质“块”。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/chemistrystuff1/0",
    "raw": "Chemical Reactions",
    "value": "化学反应"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/chemistrystuff1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've learned to make chunks of pure carbon in your lab and a couple different compounds that will be useful in agriculture and medicine.",
    "value": "^orange;1级^reset;\n\n您已学会在实验室中制造纯碳块，以及几种在农业和医学领域都颇具用途的化合物。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/chemistrystuff2/0",
    "raw": "Elemental Synthesis",
    "value": "元素合成"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/chemistrystuff2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nWith your newfound chemistry knowledge, you can now create various elemental compounds that would normally be obtained from slain foes. You can also create more advanced crystals. You'll have to upgrade to a ^orange;Chemistry Lab^reset; first, though.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n凭借新获得的化学知识，您现在可以合成多种通常需从被击败的敌人身上获取的元素化合物。您也能制造更先进的晶体。不过，首先您需要将设备升级至^orange;化学操作台^reset;。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/aliencompound/0",
    "raw": "Bio-Metallic Compounds",
    "value": "生物金属化合物"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/aliencompound/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYou've learned how to mix living material and metals in chemistry to do some bizarre things. You can produce useful Alien Compound and Quietus Ore in your lab.",
    "value": "^orange;4级^reset;\n\n您已学会如何在化学操作中混合生物质与金属，以达成一些奇特的效果。您可以在实验室中生产有用的外星化合物和寂灭矿。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/explosives1/0",
    "raw": "Explosives",
    "value": "炸药"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/explosives1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nPerhaps one of the most classic chemical reactions is something going boom. Now, you can make that happen on demand with some neat new explodables to help you mine.",
    "value": "^orange;1级^reset;\n\n或许最经典的化学反应之一，就是某物轰然爆炸的景象。现在，您可以利用一些精巧的新型爆炸物，按需制造这种反应来辅助开采。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/explosives2/0",
    "raw": "Advanced Explosives",
    "value": "高级炸药"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/explosives2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nBy using plastic in the creation of explosives, you can not only more safely contain bigger and deadlier bombs, but also easily shape your charges to make them more effective when they blow.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n通过在制造炸药时使用塑料，您不仅能更安全地封装更大、更具威力的炸弹，还能轻松塑形装药，使其在爆炸时效率更高。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/fertilizer1/0",
    "raw": "Fertilizer",
    "value": "肥料"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/fertilizer1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've begun to learn how to make useful crop-growing aids out of chemicals and can now craft basic fertilizer at your ^orange;Alchemy Table^reset;\n\nAmmonium Sulfate can be extracted from many sources. Try grinding up some Core Fragments or Poop in your Hand Mill.\n\nYou'll need a ^orange;Growing Tray^reset; to do anything with your fertilizer - if you're just growing plants out of the ground with a hoe and watering can, it won't be of any use to you.",
    "value": "^orange;1级^reset;\n\n您已开始学习如何利用化学物质制造有用的农作物生长辅助剂，现在可以在您的^orange;炼金台^reset;处制作基础化肥。\n\n硫酸铵可以从多种来源中提取。尝试以研磨机研磨一些星核碎片或粪便。\n\n您需要一个^orange;生长托盘^reset;才能使用化肥 - 如果您只是用锄头和浇水罐在地里种植作物，那么化肥对您将毫无用处。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/fertilizer2/0",
    "raw": "Improved Fertilizer",
    "value": "改良肥料"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/fertilizer2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou can make even better fertilizer using more complex chemicals. Your plants will thank you with faster growth and more yields.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n您可以利用更复杂的化学物质制造出更好的化肥。您的植物会以更快的生长速度和更高的产量来回报你。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/fertilizer3/0",
    "raw": "Peerless Fertilizer",
    "value": "绝世肥料"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/fertilizer3/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've mastered not just plant fertilization, but also the making of pesticides. Just make sure to wash it before you eat it.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您掌握的不仅是植物施肥技术，还包括杀虫剂的制造。只是吃之前务必将其清洗干净。"
  },
  {
