    "path": "/strings/research/biofuel1/0",
    "raw": "Biofuel",
    "value": "生物燃料"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/biofuel1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've learned how to make fuel out of organic matter, which can be used to fuel various generators, ship engines and mechs.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n您已经学会了如何从有机物中制造燃料。这种燃料可用于为各种发电机、飞船引擎和机甲供能。"
  },
  {
