    "raw": "Improved Biofuel",
    "value": "改良生物燃料"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/biofuel2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've learned how to make fuel out of organic matter, which can be used to fuel various generators, ship engines and mechs.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您已经学会了如何从有机物中制造燃料。这种燃料可用于为各种发电机、飞船引擎和机甲供能。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/biofuel3/0",
    "raw": "Amazing Biofuel",
    "value": "惊奇生物燃料"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/biofuel3/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYou've learned how to make fuel out of organic matter, which can be used to fuel various generators, ship engines and mechs.",
    "value": "^orange;4级^reset;\n\n你已经学会了如何从有机物中制造燃料，可以用来为各种发电机、飞船引擎和机甲提供燃料。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/liquidcrafting1/0",
    "raw": "Liquid Creation",
    "value": "液体创造"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/liquidcrafting1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've learned the basics of liquid creation and can now artifically create a few different liquid types at your lab.\n\nYou've also learned to create Cell Material, a useful resource when engineering novel plants.",
    "value": "^orange;1级^reset;\n\n您已经掌握了液体创造的基础知识，现在可以在实验室里人工制造几种不同的液体。\n\n您还学会了制造细胞材料，这是在改良新型植物时的一种有用资源。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/liquidcrafting2/0",
    "raw": "Advanced Liquids",
    "value": "高级液体"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/liquidcrafting2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou now know how to make a few more types of liquid, including some really hot or really cold ones.\n\nWith the engineered Spliced Cell, you have access to even greater genetic engineering.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n你现在掌握了制造更多种类液体的方法，其中包含一些温度极高或极低的液体。\n\n借助工程化的拼接细胞，你将能够进行更深入的基因工程。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/liquidcrafting3/0",
    "raw": "Peerless Liquid Creation",
    "value": "绝世液体创造"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/liquidcrafting3/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYou can make even more complicated liquids at your lab.",
    "value": "^orange;4级^reset;\n\n您可以在你的实验室里制造更复杂的液体。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechfuel/0",
    "raw": "Liquid Fuels",
    "value": "液体燃料"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechfuel/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYour combined knowledge of fluid creation and biofuel has led to you designing an enhanced, efficient fuel for use in mechs and combustion generators.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n您结合了在液体创造与生物燃料方面的知识，成功设计出了一种高效的增强型燃料，可用于机甲和燃烧发电机。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/cells1/0",
    "raw": "Cell Manipulation",
    "value": "细胞操作"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/cells1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou are now able to engineer advanced cells and mutagenic samples in your lab that are especially useful in bioweapons and plant design as well as craft and utilize bizarre biological slimes.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您现在可以在实验室里设计高级细胞与诱变样本，这些物质在生物武器和植物设计方面特别有用。同时，您也能够制作并利用奇异的生物软泥。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/cells2/0",
    "raw": "Cell Mastery",
    "value": "细胞精通"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/cells2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nYour knowledge of cells is vast. You can make even more strange cells and mutagenic samples.",
    "value": "^orange;5级^reset;\n\n您对细胞有着广博的认知，现在可以制造出更多奇异的细胞与诱变样本。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/elduucrystals/0",
    "raw": "Crystal Horticulture",
    "value": "水晶园艺"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/elduucrystals/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've studied the Eld'uukhar art of growing crystals like plants and can now do so yourself.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您已经研习过晶龙族将水晶如同植物般培育的技艺，现在可以亲自实践了。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/glowinggels/0",
    "raw": "Specialized Gels",
    "value": "特殊凝胶"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/glowinggels/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've developed some weird gels that glow in the dark and can accelerate anything that touches them to a high speed.",
