  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/metallichydrogen/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nNormally, this stuff is only found in the depths of gas giants, but you found a way to make it in your lab by yourself. Metallic Hydrogen is a powerful superconductor, and an amazing fuel source. Also, you found the best way to weaponize Unstable Particles - by combining them with Metallic Hydrogen to build ridiculously destructive grenades.",
    "value": "^orange;5级^reset;\n\n通常，这种物质仅存在于气态巨行星的深处，但您找到了在实验室中自行制备它的方法。金属氢是一种强大的超导体，也是一种极佳的燃料来源。此外，您还发现了将不稳定粒子武器化的最佳途径 - 将其与金属氢结合，制造出具有荒谬破坏力的手榴弹。"
  },
